1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
OrbitVitals helps astronauts review
changing health data.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Meet Noor: simulated records, checked for
data quality.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Her personal median reference is eight
hours.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Two nights are insufficient. Five prompt
review.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000
After nine, seven recorded nights show a
continuing reduction.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Two nights are missing.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Review the record with a flight surgeon.
No diagnosis is made.
